# Keep the site running

Whenever 대인 sends a message in this repo:

1. Confirm `http://127.0.0.1:8787` is serving. If it is down or on stale code, restart with `node --watch server.js` (Windows: request `all` permissions).
2. If port 8787 is already taken by an old Node process, kill that PID then start again.
3. After UI/API changes, hit `/api/gainers` or open the page so they can use it immediately.
